# Financial Statement Analysis Using Excel

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analysing a company's financial performance using Microsoft Excel.

## Objectives
- Understand the company's financial position.
- Analyse Profit & Loss statements.
- Examine Balance Sheet components.
- Review Cash Flow statements.
- Calculate and interpret important financial ratios.
- Identify trends and business performance insights.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Financial Analysis
- Data Interpretation

## Project Files
- Profit & Loss Statement
- Balance Sheet
- Cash Flow Statement
- Financial Analysis Workbook

## Key Learning Outcomes
- Understanding financial statements.
- Organising and analysing financial data in Excel.
- Developing financial analysis and business interpretation skills.

## Project Status
Financial statements have been organised in Excel. Further analysis and insights will be added as the project develops.
